Only output payoff and irreversible event recognition rules. Do not output the complete profile.

## JSON Stability Requirements
- For `summary`, write only a 60-120 character rule summary; do not copy long dialogue or full slogans from the blueprint.
- If dialogue/slogans must be quoted, use Chinese quotation marks 「」; prohibited to write unescaped English double quotes directly inside JSON strings.

